<title>CROATIA: Croatia May PPI quickens to 0.2 pct from 0.0.</title>
<headline>Croatia May PPI quickens to 0.2 pct from 0.0.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA PRODUCER PRICES     MAY 97    APRIL 97	MAY 96</p>
<p> monthly change (pct)	  +0.2	  0.0	    -0.4</p>
<p> year-on-year		    +2.3	 +1.9	    +1.2</p>
<p>NOTES -- Croatia introduced a radical anti-inflation programme in October 1993, when monthly producer price inflation was running at 29.1 percent. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
